\left(T+2\right)\times\left(\underset{\text{variables contained in the raw solution}}{9}+\underset{\text{derived variables}}{21}+\underset{\text{total tax revenue}}{1}+\underset{\text{all tax rates}}{30}\right)
\end{align*}

\end_inset

and prefill it with the initial steady state.
 The last 
\begin_inset Formula $\left(T+2-T1\right)\times30$
\end_inset

