 are of length 
\begin_inset Formula $T+2$
\end_inset

.
 If one solves for the MIT shock path, the output sequences are of length
 
\begin_inset Formula $T+2-T1$
\end_inset

.
 Updating starts from 
\begin_inset Formula $T1+1$
\end_inset

-th row of 
